<title>USA: Cedar Falls, Iowa $3.5 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Cedar Falls, Iowa $3.5 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $3.500 million of Cedar Falls, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.02 percent.</p>
</text>
